test "plan disclosure period: 21 days after the trigger" cite "S.D.N.Y. Local Civ. R. 83.10(d)"
{
  given PlanFirstAnswerFiled() on 2026-11-02
  expect deadline(plan-disclosure-period) == 2026-11-23
